# Production deploys from `main`

This app’s live/production site deploys from the **`main`** branch only.

Feature-branch pushes create preview deploys at most — they do **not** update the production suite.

## When the user asks to push, deploy, go live, or ship

1. Ensure the work is on (or merged into) **`main`**.
2. Push **`origin/main`**.
3. Tell the user production updates from `main`, not from feature branches.

## Default workflow

- Prefer committing and pushing on **`main`** for this project unless the user explicitly wants a feature branch / PR-only flow.
- If work is on a feature branch and the user wants it live, merge into `main` and push `main` — do not stop after pushing only the feature branch.
- Do not force-push `main`.
